  "html": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><table style=\"margin: 0 0 0.5em 1em; border:1px solid silver; float:right; font-size:90%; text-align:left;\" cellpadding=\"5\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"font-size:110%; text-align:center; background-color:#ACD\">The Threat Grows\n</th></tr>\n\n\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#ACD;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Quest#Section\" title=\"Quest\">Section</a>\n</th>\n<td>Primary Quests\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#ACD\"><a href=\"/wiki/Campaign\" title=\"Campaign\">Campaign</a>\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Factions\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Factions\">Factions</a>\n<p>(<a href=\"/wiki/Cantha\" title=\"Cantha\">Canthan</a> only)\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#ACD;\">Given by\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Soar_Honorclaw\" title=\"Soar Honorclaw\">Soar Honorclaw</a> <br />in <a href=\"/wiki/Kinya_Province\" title=\"Kinya Province\">Kinya Province</a> <br />(<a href=\"/wiki/Shing_Jea_Island\" title=\"Shing Jea Island\">Shing Jea Island</a>)\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#ACD;\">Preceded by\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Warning_the_Tengu\" title=\"Warning the Tengu\">Warning the Tengu</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#ACD;\">Followed by\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Journey_to_the_Master\" title=\"Journey to the Master\">Journey to the Master</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#ACD;\">Type\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Primary_quest\" title=\"Primary quest\">Primary quest</a>\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; background-color:#ACD;\">Map(s)\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<td colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:The_Threat_Grows_map.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"The Threat Grows map.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/2/26/The_Threat_Grows_map.jpg/250px-The_Threat_Grows_map.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"250\" height=\"182\" srcset=\"/images/2/26/The_Threat_Grows_map.jpg 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"288\" data-file-height=\"210\" /></a><br /><small>(Click to enlarge)</small>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>Having warned the <a href=\"/wiki/Tengu\" title=\"Tengu\">Tengu</a>, hurry on to warn an Instructor and students in Kaitan Village.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Quest_information\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Quest information</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Requirements\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Requirements</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Objectives\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Objectives</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Reward\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Reward</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Walkthrough\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Walkthrough</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#NPCs\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">NPCs</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Allies\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Allies</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Foes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Foes</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Dialogue\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Dialogue</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Initial_dialogue\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Initial dialogue</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Reward_dialogue\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Reward dialogue</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Notes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Notes</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Quest_information\">Quest information</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=The_Threat_Grows&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Quest information\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Requirements\">Requirements</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=The_Threat_Grows&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Requirements\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Cantha\" title=\"Cantha\">Canthan</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Factions\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Factions\">Factions</a>) <a href=\"/wiki/Character\" title=\"Character\">character</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Objectives\">Objectives</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=The_Threat_Grows&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Objectives\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>Travel to <a href=\"/wiki/Kaitan_Village\" title=\"Kaitan Village\">Kaitan Village</a> on the <a href=\"/wiki/Panjiang_Peninsula\" title=\"Panjiang Peninsula\">Panjiang Peninsula</a>.</li>\n<li>Destroy the sickened guards attacking Kaitan Village.</li>\n<li>See <a href=\"/wiki/Sister_Tai\" title=\"Sister Tai\">Sister Tai</a> for your reward.</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Reward\">Reward</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=The_Threat_Grows&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Reward\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>1,500 <a href=\"/wiki/Experience\" title=\"Experience\">Experience</a></li>\n<li>100 <a href=\"/wiki/Gold\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Gold\">Gold</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Walkthrough\">Walkthrough</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=The_Threat_Grows&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Walkthrough\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>This quest may seem difficult because of the groups of enemies you will be fighting, but it's really quite simple. Make your way to Kaitan Village but stay away from the quest marker to avoid <a href=\"/wiki/Spawn\" title=\"Spawn\">spawning</a> the enemies. Instead, wait on the left side of the <a href=\"/wiki/NPC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"NPC\">NPCs</a> and watch for the group of Canthan Guards to get close to the Kaitan Village sign. Once they are there, move to the NPCs and activate the spawns. The enemies will approach from the southwest. If done correctly, the level 20 Guards will kill the mobs for you and complete the quest.\n</p><p>An easy way to time this (and alleviate boredom) is to couple this mission with <a href=\"/wiki/Cash_Crops\" title=\"Cash Crops\">Cash Crops</a>. Just avoid the quest marker (after kneeling at the appropriate places for Cash Crops), by circling to it from the south, and approach from the southwest.\n</p><p>If you walk to the peninsula right after receiving the quest from Soar Honorclaw, you can talk to <a href=\"/wiki/Tahbo_Paa\" title=\"Tahbo Paa\">Tahbo Paa</a> near the map entrance to Panjiang Peninsula,  to get the quest <a href=\"/wiki/The_Agriculturist\" title=\"The Agriculturist\">The Agriculturist</a>.  You also will have higher level <a href=\"/wiki/Henchmen\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Henchmen\">henchmen</a> if you walk from <a href=\"/wiki/Ran_Musu_Gardens\" title=\"Ran Musu Gardens\">Ran Musu Gardens</a> to the peninsula.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"NPCs\">NPCs</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=The_Threat_Grows&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: NPCs\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Allies\">Allies</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=The_Threat_Grows&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Allies\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Human\" title=\"Human\">Humans</a>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Elementalist-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Elementalist\"><img alt=\"Elementalist\" src=\"/images/a/ab/Elementalist-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 7 (20) <a href=\"/wiki/Ako\" title=\"Ako\">Ako</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Elementalist-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Elementalist\"><img alt=\"Elementalist\" src=\"/images/a/ab/Elementalist-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 5 (20) <a href=\"/wiki/Hakaru\" title=\"Hakaru\">Hakaru</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Elementalist-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Elementalist\"><img alt=\"Elementalist\" src=\"/images/a/ab/Elementalist-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 5 (20) <a href=\"/wiki/Siyan\" title=\"Siyan\">Siyan</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Monk-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Monk\"><img alt=\"Monk\" src=\"/images/f/f8/Monk-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 10 (20) <a href=\"/wiki/Sister_Tai\" title=\"Sister Tai\">Sister Tai</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Foes\">Foes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=The_Threat_Grows&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Foes\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Afflicted\" title=\"Afflicted\">Afflicted</a>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Warrior-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Warrior\"><img alt=\"Warrior\" src=\"/images/3/3b/Warrior-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 8 (23) <a href=\"/wiki/Sickened_Guard_(warrior)\" title=\"Sickened Guard (warrior)\">Sickened Guard</a> x2</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Ranger-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Ranger\"><img alt=\"Ranger\" src=\"/images/d/dc/Ranger-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 8 (23), 10 (24) <a href=\"/wiki/Sickened_Guard_(ranger)\" title=\"Sickened Guard (ranger)\">Sickened Guard</a> x2</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Ritualist-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Ritualist\"><img alt=\"Ritualist\" src=\"/images/8/81/Ritualist-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 8 (23) <a href=\"/wiki/Sickened_Scribe\" title=\"Sickened Scribe\">Sickened Scribe</a> x2</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Dialogue\">Dialogue</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=The_Threat_Grows&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Dialogue\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Initial_dialogue\">Initial dialogue</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=The_Threat_Grows&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Initial dialogue\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<dl><dd><b>Soar Honorclaw</b>\n<dl><dd><i>While you were away dealing with that plague creature, <a href=\"/wiki/Ang_the_Ephemeral\" title=\"Ang the Ephemeral\">Ang the Ephemeral</a> left a message for you. Apparently, several of your fellow students are visiting Kaitan Village on the Panjiang Peninsula, but <a href=\"/wiki/Master_Togo\" title=\"Master Togo\">Master Togo</a> has sensed a growing threat in that area, and he believes that the students might be in mortal danger. He wants you to travel with all speed to <b>Kaitan Village</b> in <b>Panjiang Pensinsula</b> <small>[<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sic\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Sic\"><span title=\"w:Sic\"><i>sic</i></span></a>]</small> and help them deal with any threat.</i></dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><dl><dd><a href=\"/wiki/File:Tick_green.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Yes\"><img alt=\"Yes\" src=\"/images/5/52/Tick_green.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a>&#160;<b>Accept:</b> <i>\"I will leave at once.\"</i></dd>\n<dd><a href=\"/wiki/File:Icon_No_ingame.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"No\"><img alt=\"No\" src=\"/images/0/09/Icon_No_ingame.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a>&#160;<b>Decline:</b> <i>\"Surely, the threat is not so dire.\"</i></dd>\n<dd><a href=\"/wiki/File:Tango-question-mark.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Ask\"><img alt=\"Ask\" src=\"/images/a/ab/Tango-question-mark.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a>&#160;<b>Ask:</b> <i>\"The message from Ang the Ephemeral indicated that you should hurry to <b>Kaitan Village</b> on the <b>Panjiang Peninsula</b>.\"</i></dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Reward_dialogue\">Reward dialogue</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=The_Threat_Grows&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section: Reward dialogue\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<dl><dd><b>Sister Tai</b>\n<dl><dd><i>It is so good to see you &lt;Character Name&gt;. Master Togo sent word that help was coming, and here you are. You arrived just in time.</i></dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=The_Threat_Grows&amp;action=edit&amp;section=12\" title=\"Edit section: Notes\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Instructor Weng Gha does not participate in combat, even if he is standing within aggro range of the fighting.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261009035337\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.037 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.049 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 520/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 4959/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1359/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 9/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\n-->\n<!--\nTranscl